2025-09-30 20:59:41,772 [WARNING] Skipped idx=119: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: In humans, two isoforms of p73 have been identified: full-length (TAp73) and N-terminally truncated (deltaNp73). The TAp73 isoform is covalently modified by NEDD8 under physiologic conditions in an Mdm2-dependent manner, which regulates its transactivation function. This modification leads to the cytoplasmic localization of TAp73, thereby attenuating its ability to activate p53- and p73-responsive promoters. The deltaNp73 isoform, on the other hand, lacks this NEDD8 modification and is associated with anti-apoptotic properties. Thus, the TAp73 isoform is the one that is primarily involved in the described mechanism of regulation by the Mdm2-NEDD8 pathway.'
